WEBVTT

01:00:27.109 --> 01:00:30.193
The next big frontier,
it seems to me, is desire.

01:00:30.217 --> 01:00:32.898
What are our motivations?
Where do our desires come from?

01:00:32.922 --> 01:00:36.152
How come I can't force myself
to love clams?

01:00:36.176 --> 01:00:38.540
Where does that desire come from?

01:00:38.564 --> 01:00:42.621
So, to me, knowledge is now plentiful,
but motivation is scarce.

01:00:42.645 --> 01:00:46.386
And so, figuring out what motivates people
is really the next frontier

01:00:46.410 --> 01:00:48.177
in understanding ourselves.

01:00:48.201 --> 01:00:50.091
What are our desires?

01:00:50.115 --> 01:00:53.266
CA: What will motivate
people to make change?

01:00:53.290 --> 01:00:57.187
Is it that the assumption
of a lot of activists

01:00:57.211 --> 01:01:02.302
is that you have to really
turn up the level of concern?